  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Employment in Iraq and Kurdistan Region of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unemployment is a big issue in the Kurdistan Region of Iraq and Iraq as a whole. The unemployment rate among the youth  is close to 27.2%. This is partly due to mismatch between the demand for high quality employees and the poor supply of skilled labor. Through this project, around 200 young people will receive trainings on soft skills and relevant technical skills. After their training, the youth will be introduced to  job opportunities in the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
